// probe: stated
// about: a copy read and `??` of a conditional lend whose prologue suspends, or prologue and epilogue, a method's and a subscript's, present and absent (SL-860)
// stage 0: cannot parse a `borrow` copy read
// speeds: -O0 -O2
// prints: pro find 0
// prints: epi find 0 t=0
// prints: epi end find 0
// prints: drop tr 0
// prints: copy_read_borrow P present 10
// prints: pro find 9
// prints: drop tr 9
// prints: copy_read_borrow P absent -1
// prints: pro find 0
// prints: epi find 0 t=0
// prints: epi end find 0
// prints: drop tr 0
// prints: copy_read_borrow B present 10
// prints: pro find 9
// prints: drop tr 9
// prints: copy_read_borrow B absent -1
